idioms.lus:4:1: warning: use 'from' destructuring: local ... from config [use-from]
idioms.lus:10:1: warning: nested nil checks can use optional chaining: x?.y?.z [use-optional-chain]
idioms.lus:16:13: warning: and-chain can use optional chaining: x?.y?.z [use-optional-chain]
